{{Quote|text=Well, I suppose I'll return you to that adorable farm of yours. Next time you feel the urge to adventure, consider lending Castle Village your aid.}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an antisocial NPC and the witch of Castle Village, managing its defence efforts and inhabitants. She expends immense amounts of mana to oversee its barrier, which is the largest in the world.

She possesses a mischievous, flirtatious attitude, equal parts flippant and dutiful. Camilla alone permits residence in Castle Village, and she is notably strict in doing so.

