==Quotes==
<!---Keep to a list of 5 quotes for general section and 2-3 for events--->
Here is a selection of {{PAGENAME}}'s dialogue lines.
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* General <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Regular}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Mondays|quote= "Surprised to see me? Razzy and I have important matters to discuss today."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Thursdays|quote= "Hello, dear. Have you come to aid Castle Village? There's more monsters than usual loitering around today..."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Fridays|quote= "Beautiful view from here, right? Sand, sand, and more sand. Is it wrong that I think some of the monsters we fight are kind of cute? ...Not enough to take home, or anything."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Sunday|quote= "We've figured out lots of handy tricks around here to deal with our little monster problem. See that green fire? It's a magical deterrent that *strongly discourages* them from encroaching on this tower. With fire..."}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">* Events <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
{{QuotesTableStart|label = Events}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Desert Festival|quote= "You strike me as someone with an inquisitive nature, climbing up these cliffs... I prefer watching from afar. I tasked Jadu with some errands."}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

